id: electrified
name: Electrified
kind: battlefield
envQuality: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Live ground. 2(bT) Life Points at the start and end of your turn, and ending a turn on
  it leaves you Impeded until your next one begins.
text: >
  Electrified: If you start or end your Turn in this Battle Environment, reduce your Life
  Points by 2(bT). If you end your turn in this Battle Environment, gain the Impediment
  Combat Condition until the start of your next turn.

---

# Aflame's damage without the Broken rider, and a Condition on the way out.
#
# Two sentences with two different triggers, which is the thing to read carefully: the
# damage is "start or end", and the Impediment is "end" alone. So the end of a turn does
# both and the start does one, and writing it as a single block would have quietly given
# Impediment twice a turn.
#
# "Until the start of your next turn" is the edge Brace uses: a start edge is never ahead of
# you during your own turn, so it lifts as your next turn begins.

[automatic/start-of-turn]
life.value -= 2(bT);

[automatic/end-of-turn]
life.value -= 2(bT);
gain(impediment);
expires(impediment, start-of-next-turn);
